### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/

###

### ========================================
### ENDPOINTS PÚBLICOS
### ========================================

### 1. Registrar Usuario
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

### 2. Login (Guarda sesión en DynamoDB)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

### Guardar token de la respuesta del login
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

###

### ========================================
### ENDPOINTS PROTEGIDOS (Requieren token)
### ========================================

### 3. Obtener Usuario por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 4. Logout (Elimina sesión de DynamoDB)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 5. Intentar acceder después del logout (debe fallar)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ========================================
### EJEMPLOS CON DIFERENTES USUARIOS
### ========================================

### Registrar segundo usuario
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Jane Doe",
  "email": "jane@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass456!"
}

###

### Login con segundo usuario
# @name loginJane
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "jane@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass456!"
}

###

@tokenJane = {{loginJane.response.body.token}}

###

### Obtener usuario con token de Jane
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenJane}}

###

### ========================================
### CASOS DE ERROR
### ========================================

### Error: Email duplicado
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Duplicate User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

### Error: Credenciales inválidas
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "WrongPassword!"
}

###

### Error: Token inválido
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer invalid.token.here

###

### Error: Sin token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1

###

### Error: Validación - Password corto
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "short@example.com",
  "password": "123"
}

###

### Error: Validación - Email inválido
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

### Error: Usuario no encontrado
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
